%% Figure: Door check-in (EH-01 to EH-04).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Helper
    participant SPA as SPA check-in screen
    participant T as Ticket service
    participant DB as MySQL

    H->>SPA: open check-in for event 42
    SPA->>T: POST /scanner/sessions {eventId 42} (Cognito JWT)
    T->>DB: event exists, not CANCELLED
    T->>DB: membership HELPER or ORGANISER, invite ACCEPTED
    T-->>SPA: HMAC-SHA256 signed session token (event-scoped, expires)
    H->>SPA: scan QR (camera or image upload)
    SPA->>T: POST /tickets/validate {qrToken} (scanner session)
    T->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT ticket BY qr_token FOR UPDATE
    alt no such ticket
        T->>DB: INSERT check_in_logs INVALID (attempted token)
    else ticket for another event
        T->>DB: INSERT check_in_logs WRONG_EVENT
    else status ISSUED
        T->>DB: UPDATE status CHECKED_IN, checked_in_by
        T->>DB: INSERT check_in_logs SUCCESS
    else already CHECKED_IN or VOID
        T->>DB: INSERT check_in_logs DUPLICATE or INVALID
    end
    T->>DB: COMMIT
    T-->>SPA: result + ticket summary
    SPA-->>H: green / amber / red result screen
